      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Grant took the time to attend site and talk me through the technical restrictions of the install, the depth of planning he showed was not addressed by the other companies that quoted the job.In addition I also chose Mako because they were the ‘smaller company’ of the three. There are obviously risks from doing so but I will always support the smaller business first.The install was as agreed and looked as good as any solar system I have seen.Mako arranged arranged for the new smart meter to be installed.There were some teething issues relating to the commissioning of the system but this was due to the Fronius components not communicating with the online portal. However Grant was committed to resolving the issue until completed.",
