      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Grant from Mako Solar provided a compeditive quote, with all the relevant details that we required of the job. They were prompt in getting the job underway and carried out a high quality installation, considering the difficult logistics of connecting the system to a remote meterboard. The result was esthetically pleasing with regard to hidden ducting and inverter location. They left the job site clean.Once the installation was complete, Grant came over to run through the particulars of the Solaredge app and gave good advice on solar feed in tariffs. He also upgraded the system to allow remote individual panel monitoring at no extra cost. Grid connection was done promptly.Overall, we found their installation excellent.",
